WEBVTT

00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:30.044
Javob 1 soniyada

00:01:30.461 --> 00:01:32.880
Muammoni yechishning 
bir necha usullari mavjud.

00:01:32.922 --> 00:01:35.007
Keling, eng oddiysidan boshlaylik.

00:01:35.007 --> 00:01:38.302
Tunneldagi joylashuvni belgilashning
aniq bir usuli mavjud:

00:01:38.386 --> 00:01:40.012
shamning holati.

00:01:40.012 --> 00:01:43.933
Birinchi shamni uni yoqish
yoki yoniq qoldirish orqali belgilaysiz

00:01:44.183 --> 00:01:47.770
Agar siz oldinga yursangiz, oxir-oqibat 
boshqa yonayotgan shamni topasiz —

00:01:47.937 --> 00:01:50.565
yoki avvalgisi yoki boshqasi.

00:01:50.565 --> 00:01:53.526
Savol: siz qaysiligini qanday bilasiz?

00:01:53.568 --> 00:01:57.613
Mana bir yondashuv: uni o’chiring 
va boshiga qayting, bunda

00:01:57.613 --> 00:02:01.784
yo’lda bir xil miqdordagi
shamlardan o’tish orqali.